{"channelId":"UCWevh3DUA1sXJS-N318trSw","row":["Animal Rescue Farm! 🐾",7,"🐾 Welcome to Animal Rescue Farm — where every animal gets a second chance at life!\n\nWe rescue, rehabilitate, and rehome ALL kinds of animals — from abandoned puppies\nand stray cats to neglected farm animals like cows, goats, rabbits, and more.\nEvery rescue story you see here is REAL. These are lives saved, one animal at a time.\n\nOn this channel, you will find:\n   🐕  Heartwarming dog and cat rescue stories\n   🐄  Farm animal rescues — cows, goats, sheep, rabbits and more\n   💛  Transformation videos — from scared and sick to happy and healthy\n   🏡  Adoption success stories that will make your heart smile\n   🌿  Life on the rescue farm — real, raw, and beautiful\n\nEvery animal deserves love, safety, and a forever home.\nJoin our rescue family and help us spread the word!\n\nDon't forget to LIKE, SUBSCRIBE, and hit the BELL so you never miss a rescue story.\n\nTogether, we can save more lives. 🐾\n\nAdopt. Don't Shop.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWevh3DUA1sXJS-N318trSw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWevh3DUA1sXJS-N318trSw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:59.405Z","channelId":"UCWevh3DUA1sXJS-N318trSw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"dfa581770d4f8b6881716a3524fc6a3ff3d6aeff0eb31b12d3c919c1cf36b81f","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"53f7e62508f3bad4a378c76996507ffd741e01697cbd5b4eaf93129d7414685b"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWevh3DUA1sXJS-N318trSw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:59.405Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWevh3DUA1sXJS-N318trSw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":7,"raw":"7 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWevh3DUA1sXJS-N318trSw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:59.405Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"